---
layout: null
permalink: /measurements/search.json
sitemap: false
---
{%- comment -%}
  /measurements/search.json — THE BRIDGE STUB (plan 2026-09-10 § D7 (3); WS-M0 while WS-M3 is in
  wave 2). The measurements catalog's real search record is generated by _plugins/measurements.rb
  from the release's measurements.json; until a release carries one, this file is built from the
  release's OWN coverage — `variables[realm == "env"]` of coverage.json, the same rows the front
  door's counts are read from — so the search box finds a measurement by its key, its category or
  its dataset from the first day, and not one number or name is typed.

  When WS-M3 ships, its generator writes this URL and THIS FILE IS DELETED: a generated page and a
  source page of the same permalink would collide. Until then the rows' `u` is the Explorer opened
  on that variable, never a /measurements/ page that does not exist.

  Row shape (as /species/search.json):
    n  the key      c  the category      r  the datasets it is measured in
    o  values at the release grain       u  the way in       t  the haystack
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign cov = site.data.release_coverage -%}
{%- assign env = cov.variables | where: "realm", "env" -%}
{%- assign groups = env | group_by: "measurement_type" -%}
{"release": {{ cov.version | default: "" | jsonify }}, "stub": true, "rows": [
{%- for g in groups -%}
{%- assign first = g.items | first -%}
{%- assign n_obs = 0 -%}
{%- for v in g.items %}{% assign n_obs = n_obs | plus: v.n_obs %}{% endfor -%}
{%- assign dskeys = g.items | map: "dataset_key" | uniq -%}
{%- assign dsnames = "" | split: "" -%}
{%- for k in dskeys -%}
{%- assign d = site.data.catalog.index[k] -%}
{%- assign dsn = d.short | default: d.name | default: k -%}
{%- assign dsnames = dsnames | push: dsn -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- capture hay -%}{{ g.name }} {{ first.category }} {{ dskeys | join: " " }} {{ dsnames | join: " " }}{%- endcapture -%}
{% unless forloop.first %},{% endunless %}{"n": {{ g.name | jsonify }}, "c": {{ first.category | jsonify }}, "r": {{ dsnames | join: " · " | jsonify }}, "o": {{ n_obs }}, "y0": {{ first.year_min | default: 0 }}, "y1": {{ first.year_max | default: 0 }}, "u": {{ "https://calcofi.io/explore/?var=" | append: g.name | jsonify }}, "t": {{ hay | downcase | strip | jsonify }}}
{%- endfor -%}
]}
